   "Safe Raja Ampat · Data lapangan": "Safe Raja Ampat · Field data",
   "Dibangun untuk lokasi tempat jaringan tidak bisa diandalkan.": "Built for places where the network cannot be relied on.",
   "Offline-first dan sinkronisasi": "Offline-first and synchronisation",
   "Petugas mengisi data di lokasi bencana, sering kali di titik tanpa sinyal sama sekali.": "Officers enter data at disaster sites, often at points with no signal at all.",
   "Data tersimpan lebih dulu di perangkat": "Data is stored on the device first",
   "Formulir dan survei tetap dapat diisi tanpa jaringan, lalu tersinkronisasi otomatis saat perangkat kembali online.": "Forms and surveys can still be filled in without a network, then synchronise automatically once the device is back online.",
   "Laporan tidak hilang saat koneksi terputus": "Reports are not lost when the connection drops",
   "Isian tersimpan bertahap, sehingga pekerjaan setengah jalan tetap aman.": "Entries are saved as they go, so half-finished work stays safe.",
   "Survei yang dibuat sendiri": "Surveys built in-house",
   "Admin menyusun template survei sesuai kebutuhan hari itu, dan petugas mengisinya di lapangan.": "Admins put together survey templates to suit that day's needs, and officers fill them in out in the field.",
   "Formulir terstruktur standar nasional": "Structured forms to the national standard",
   "Yang biasanya diisi di atas kertas kini terisi langsung di lokasi, dalam format yang sudah dikenal seluruh jajaran.": "What is usually filled in on paper is now filled in directly on site, in a format that is already familiar across the ranks.",
   "Pengumpulan Data (Format-2)": "Data Collection (Format-2)",
   "Instrumen data awal korban, pengungsi, dan kebutuhan.": "An instrument for initial data on casualties, displaced people, and needs.",
