   "Laporan Lanjutan (Format-6)": "Follow-up Report (Format-6)",
   "Pembaruan berkala situasi dan kebutuhan tanggap darurat.": "Periodic updates on the situation and on emergency response needs.",
   "Laporan Harian Pusdalops": "Pusdalops Daily Report",
   "Rekap harian situasi, prakiraan cuaca, dan gelombang.": "A daily recap of the situation, the weather forecast, and the waves.",
   "Tanggap darurat": "Emergency response",
   "Sumber resmi OpenWeatherMap": "Official OpenWeatherMap source",
   "Terhubung ke nomor layanan resmi": "Connected to official service numbers",
   "Sumber data eksternal": "External data sources",
   "Informasi yang menyangkut keselamatan diambil dari penyedia yang dapat dipertanggungjawabkan.": "Information that concerns safety is drawn from providers that can be held accountable.",
   "Peta dan rute": "Maps and routes",
   "Titik penting seperti rumah sakit dan dermaga ditampilkan di peta, lengkap dengan rute menuju lokasi terdekat.": "Key points such as hospitals and jetties are shown on the map, complete with routes to the nearest location.",
   "Prakiraan cuaca": "Weather forecast",
   "Data cuaca tiga hari ke depan per tiga jam bersumber dari OpenWeatherMap.": "Weather data for the next three days, in three-hour steps, comes from OpenWeatherMap.",
   "Nomor layanan resmi": "Official service numbers",
   "Panggilan darurat terhubung langsung ke 112, 117, 110, 113, 119, dan 115.": "Emergency calls connect directly to 112, 117, 110, 113, 119, and 115.",
   "Tumpukan teknologi": "Technology stack",
   "Apa yang kami pakai, dan kenapa.": "What we use, and why.",
   "Satu basis kode untuk Android dan web. Perbaikan cukup dikerjakan sekali, sehingga biaya pemeliharaan jauh lebih rendah bagi klien.": "A single codebase for Android and web. A fix only has to be done once, so maintenance costs are far lower for the client.",
   "Basis data relasional yang matang dengan keamanan tingkat baris, sehingga satu instansi hanya melihat datanya sendiri.": "A mature relational database with row-level security, so one government agency sees only its own data.",
   "Menopang token CYV, jejak peristiwa, dan pencetakan NFT. Biaya transaksinya dapat diprediksi, sehingga skala besar tetap terencana.": "Underpins the CYV token, the event trail, and NFT minting. Its transaction costs are predictable, so large scale can still be planned for.",
   "API model AI": "AI model APIs",
   "Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, dan DeepSeek dipanggil melalui API resmi untuk asisten, gambar, dan musik.": "Gemini, ChatGPT, Claude, and DeepSeek are called through official APIs for the assistant, for images, and for music.",
   "Pengenalan wajah": "Face recognition",
   "Wajah diubah menjadi kode terenkripsi untuk verifikasi presensi, bukan disimpan sebagai foto.": "Faces are turned into encrypted code for attendance verification, not stored as photos.",
   "Peta & geofencing": "Maps & geofencing",
   "Penguncian radius untuk presensi, serta pemetaan titik penting dan rute evakuasi.": "Radius locking for attendance, plus mapping of key points and evacuation routes.",
   "Data tersimpan di perangkat lebih dulu, lalu tersinkronisasi otomatis begitu jaringan kembali tersedia.": "Data is stored on the device first, then synchronises automatically as soon as the network is available again.",
   "Enkripsi SSL/TLS": "SSL/TLS encryption",
   "Seluruh transmisi antara aplikasi, dashboard, dan server dilindungi protokol enkripsi standar.": "All transmission between the app, the dashboard, and the server is protected by standard encryption protocols.",
   "Nama dan merek layanan pihak ketiga adalah milik pemiliknya masing-masing. DIBSEN TECH menggunakan layanan tersebut melalui jalur resmi dan tidak berafiliasi dengan, tidak disponsori oleh, maupun mewakili perusahaan-perusahaan tersebut.": "Third-party service names and brands are the property of their respective owners. DIBSEN TECH uses those services through official channels and is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or representing those companies.",
