   "Kebijakan Privasi SIPneX.": "SIPneX Privacy Policy.",
   "Kami berkomitmen menjaga keamanan data pribadi, biometrik, dan lokasi setiap pengguna aplikasi SIPneX.": "We are committed to keeping the personal, biometric, and location data of every SIPneX app user secure.",
